-- words --
In a test store, one act of each kind (add goal, place, run, select, land, close, unselect and a read) writes its event; each event kind is stored, in git or in the clone's trace, where the line of `hyp spec` that names it says.
-- run --
hyp spec
-- floor: contains --
every event kind is stored where hyp spec says
